<title>USA: BankAtlantic ends pact to acquire Oriole.</title>
<headline>BankAtlantic ends pact to acquire Oriole.</headline>
<dateline>FORT LAUDERDALE, Fla. 1997-08-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>BankAtlantic Bancorp Inc on  Friday said that it is not going to proceed with its previously announced  acquisition of a controlling interest in Oriole Homes Corp from the  Levy family.</p>
<p>BankAtlantic said that it has decided that Oriole is not the right  platform for initiating its future real estate activities.&quot;</p>
<p>In June, BancAtlantic said it would purchase the controlling interest  for $12 per share, or about $22.4 million.</p>
</text>
